SUMMARY:Zombie Bike Parade Festival
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 31\, 2026\n11am to 3pm\nCommunity Park\n1405 F Street\, Davis \nFREE\, all ages\, no bike needed. \nThe bike parade leaves at 11am (line up by 10:30) and is back by 12:30. It is just under 5 miles\, from Community Park to Mace Ranch Park and back\, with a BMX stunt show at the halfway point. \nSkydiving finale at 2:30pm at Community Park\, weather permitting. \nDowntown Trick-or-Treat Trail 3 to 5pm. \nNo balloon rides and no Friday night party this year. Net proceeds go to NorCal Trykers. Full details: zombiebikeparade.com \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/zombie-bike-parade-festival/
LOCATION:Community Park\, 203 E 14th St\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
