SUMMARY:UC Davis Multicultural Calendar - November 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Multicultural Calendar is a valuable tool for enhancing understanding\, and respect for religious and cultural observances.  It serves as a resource for students\, staff\, and faculty to plan events\, activities\, meetings\, retreats\, and courses throughout the year. Developed by the Office of Campus and Community Relations through research and community input\, we welcome contributions from community members to ensure its accuracy and comprehensiveness.  \nFor the list\, visit: https://excellence.ucdavis.edu/events/multicultural-calendar-november-2026.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/uc-davis-multicultural-calendar-november-2026/
