DESCRIPTION:We invite children ages 8 through 14 to join artist Ramona Gar
 cía for a Día de los Muertos doll-making workshop. Participants will be 
 making and decorating traditional Mexican Lupita dolls. Ramona García wil
 l share the history of the Lupita doll as a beloved folk toy from Central 
 Mexico and will guide the participants through the process of doll-making.
  Registration is required. The workshop is limited to 20 participants. Par
 ents may accompany their children and help them during the workshop but ma
 terials will be provided for the children only.\n\n\n\nYou can register he
 re or at the Children's Desk in person.
