BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/munchie-man-grand-opening/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Munchie Man: Grand Opening
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T023000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T130000
UID:10002216-1793701800-1793739600@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:There’s a new spot in Downtown Davis! Join us on November 3 
 to celebrate the grand opening of Munchie Man! \nThe festivities kick off 
 with a special ribbon-cutting ceremony hosted by the Davis Chamber of Comm
 erce at 10:30 AM\, followed by doors opening to the public at 11:00 AM. \n
 Come welcome Munchie Man to the downtown community and check out Davis’ 
 newest addition! \nLearn more: www.munchiemandavis.com \n \nMunchie Man st
 arted as a 2023 pop-up in East Sacramento and now in 2026 we are a “funk
 y bistro” specializing in local craft beer & wine with small plates. \nE
 verything you’ll find here tells a story. The menu is inspired by my tra
 vels\, the restaurants that left an impression on me\, and the people and 
 experiences that shaped who I am. In many ways\, it’s an autobiography t
 old through food. Some dishes are inspired by places I’ve visited\, othe
 rs by people I love\, and a few simply exist because they make me smile. A
 nd I hope they make you smile too.
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/munchie-man-grand-opening/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
