DESCRIPTION:Davis Community Church invites participants to Gentle Yoga\, a slower-paced\, grounding practice led by Jennifer Hogan and Diane Parro. Sessions offer an opportunity to stretch\, strengthen\, breathe\, and reconnect with body and spirit in a welcoming environment.Classes take place Tuesdays from 10:15 to 11:15 a.m. in the Fireside Room. The final sessions are October 27\, November 3\, and November 10. The cost is $20 per session\, with a sliding scale available. Click here for the registration form.
