DESCRIPTION:Join us for the chance to hear from current graduate students 
 from different fields about the real experience of being in graduate schoo
 l\, including the application process\, the everyday tasks\, financial rea
 lities\, opportunities\, and more. This will be a chance for you to networ
 k\, ask any questions you may have\, and get insight into whether or not g
 rad school is the right fit for you and your goals.\n\nPlease register her
 e: https://tinyurl.com/gradpanel-fall2026\n\n"Is Graduate School Right for
  Me?" is a grad student panel and networking event hosted by the AATC 's P
 re-Graduate/Law Advising and the Undergraduate Research Center.
