SUMMARY:Complimentary Tickets: Joy Koy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T220000
UID:696a8b5a01de8bf04edd3f49b9bf11ea10222026_6:44:02_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Ticket to Dream Foundation has donated 10 FREE tickets and 3 p
 arking passes to GSP to see Jo Koy at Golden 1 (only 1 ticket per person).
  We will prioritize the first 10 students who sign up and have completed a
 t least 2 of the 3 GSP Program Requirements: https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu
 /guardianscholars/program-requirements/. \n\nIt is important that students
  complete the requirements on a quarterly basis to continue to be consider
 ed for these opportunities. \n\nIf you are not among the first 10 students
 \, make sure to add yourself to the list\, as some students may drop. \n\n
 Among the first 10 students\, we are looking for 3 students willing to dri
 ve. Parking passes and directions will be provided.\n\nSelections will be 
 sent starting November 4th.
